- this library is not available from public Maven repositories: it is republished
  here unmodified, under the org.gov4j.thirdparty.* namespaces
- no patch is applied and there is nothing to rebuild: the published jar differs from
  the original only by the META-INF/maven entries that packaging adds
- this directory holds only the pom.xml used to publish it; the artifacts themselves
  are available from Maven Central:
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.gov4j.thirdparty.org.restlet.jee/org.restlet/2.4.0
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.gov4j.thirdparty.org.restlet.jee/org.restlet.ext.servlet/2.4.0
    https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.gov4j.thirdparty.org.restlet.jee/org.restlet.ext.velocity/2.4.0
